  "reasoning": "The defendant purchased industrial salt and falsely represented it as edible salt, selling it for profit. The salt did not meet food safety standards, constituting the illegal act of selling food that fails to meet safety standards, which is punishable under the Criminal Law as the crime of selling unsafe food. No other crimes are indicated in the facts.\n\nTherefore, the appropriate charge is the crime of selling food that does not meet safety standards.",
